#! btw 1
#! name: silent-mute
#! license: CC0-1.0
#! visibility: public
# Listening-test fixture: a deck muted and never put back (the djapp filter_exit move left its strip muted for good).
# listen must flag deck B as muted.
# expect: silent deck=B reason=mute
# expect: heard deck=A
tempo 124
deck B: mute
deck A: kick x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ | hihat ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~ ~ ~ x ~
deck B: bass a2 ~ ~ a2 ~ ~ a2 ~ ~ ~ c3 ~ e2 ~ ~ ~ inst=sub-bass
end at bar 8
